{"seq":1,"slug":"ast-based-formatting","title":"基于 AST 的格式化原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/ast-based-formatting","wordCount":1691,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于-ast-的格式化原理\">基于 AST 的格式化原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码格式化的本质是将源代码转换为符合特定风格约定的等价代码。现代格式化工具的核心思路是：<strong>先将代码解析为抽象语法树（AST），再根据规则将 AST 重新输出为格式化后的文本</strong>。这种方式与基于正则表达式的字符串替换截然不同，它能够理解代码的语义结构，从而做出更精确、更一致的格式化决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[源代码文本] --&gt; B[词法分析 Lexer]&#10;    B --&gt; C[语法分析 Parser]&#10;    C --&gt; D[AST 抽象语法树]&#10;    D --&gt; E[格式化规则引擎]&#10;    E --&gt; F[中间表示 IR / Doc]&#10;    F --&gt; G[行宽约束求解]&#10;    G --&gt; H[格式化后代码]\">flowchart LR\n    A[源代码文本] --&gt; B[词法分析 Lexer]\n    B --&gt; C[语法分析 Parser]\n    C --&gt; D[AST 抽象语法树]\n    D --&gt; E[格式化规则引擎]\n    E --&gt; F[中间表示 IR / Doc]\n    F --&gt; G[行宽约束求解]\n    G --&gt; H[格式化后代码]</pre><p>基于字符串与基于 AST 两种格式化方式的本质区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>基于字符串/正则</th>\n<th>基于 AST</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解析粒度</td>\n<td>字符/行级别匹配</td>\n<td>语法节点级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义理解</td>\n<td>无，纯文本操作</td>\n<td>完整理解代码结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理嵌套结构</td>\n<td>极易出错</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式化一致性</td>\n<td>依赖正则覆盖度</td>\n<td>完全确定性输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错能力</td>\n<td>部分场景可工作</td>\n<td>语法错误时可能失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需要完整解析器）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型工具</td>\n<td>早期 IDE 内置格式化</td>\n<td>Prettier、gofmt、rustfmt</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AST 格式化的核心优势在于<strong>幂等性</strong>——无论输入代码风格如何混乱，只要语义相同，输出结果必然一致。这一特性彻底消除了团队中关于代码风格的争论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ast-解析与节点遍历\">AST 解析与节点遍历</h2><p>AST 是源代码的树状表示，每个节点对应一个语法结构。以 JavaScript 为例，一段简单的变量声明 <code>const x = 1 + 2;</code> 会被解析为如下结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ASTNode {&#10;  type: string;&#10;  start: number;&#10;  end: number;&#10;  children?: ASTNode[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ast: ASTNode = {&#10;  type: &#39;VariableDeclaration&#39;,&#10;  kind: &#39;const&#39;,&#10;  declarations: [&#10;    {&#10;      type: &#39;VariableDeclarator&#39;,&#10;      id: { type: &#39;Identifier&#39;, name: &#39;x&#39; },&#10;      init: {&#10;        type: &#39;BinaryExpression&#39;,&#10;        operator: &#39;+&#39;,&#10;        left: { type: &#39;NumericLiteral&#39;, value: 1 },&#10;        right: { type: &#39;NumericLiteral&#39;, value: 2 },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VariableDeclaration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'const'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declarations: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VariableDeclarator'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      id: { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Identifier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      init: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BinaryExpression'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        operator: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'+'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left: { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NumericLiteral'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right: { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NumericLiteral'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>格式化工具通常使用<strong>深度优先遍历</strong>来访问 AST 的每个节点。在遍历过程中，工具会为每个节点生成对应的格式化指令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function formatNode(node: ASTNode, context: FormatContext): Doc {&#10;  switch (node.type) {&#10;    case &#39;VariableDeclaration&#39;:&#10;      return concat([&#10;        node.kind,&#10;        &#39; &#39;,&#10;        join(&#10;          &#39;, &#39;,&#10;          node.declarations.map((d) =&gt; formatNode(d, context)),&#10;        ),&#10;        &#39;;&#39;,&#10;      ]);&#10;    case &#39;BinaryExpression&#39;:&#10;      return group([formatNode(node.left, context), &#39; &#39;, node.operator, line, formatNode(node.right, context)]);&#10;    default:&#10;      return printRaw(node);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormatContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Doc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.type) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'VariableDeclaration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> concat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        node.kind,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          ', '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          node.declarations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d, context)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ';'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BinaryExpression'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.left, context), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, node.operator, line, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.right, context)]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> printRaw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不同的解析器对同一语言会产生不同的 AST 结构。JavaScript 生态中常见的解析器包括 Babel Parser、Acorn、TypeScript Compiler API 以及较新的 SWC Parser。Prettier 早期主要依赖 Babel Parser，后来逐步支持了多种解析器以适应不同场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中间表示与-doc-命令\">中间表示与 Doc 命令</h2><p>AST 到最终文本之间，格式化工具通常引入一层<strong>中间表示（Intermediate Representation）</strong>。Prettier 借鉴了 Philip Wadler 的论文《A Prettier Printer》，使用了一套称为 <strong>Doc</strong> 的中间表示系统。</p>\n<p>Doc 是一组描述文本布局的命令，核心命令包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Doc 命令</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>concat</code></td>\n<td>拼接多个 Doc</td>\n<td>将声明关键字和标识符连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>group</code></td>\n<td>标记一组内容可折叠</td>\n<td>函数参数列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>indent</code></td>\n<td>增加缩进层级</td>\n<td>进入代码块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>line</code></td>\n<td>可折叠换行（group 内可变为空格）</td>\n<td>参数之间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hardline</code></td>\n<td>强制换行</td>\n<td>语句结束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>softline</code></td>\n<td>group 展开时换行，折叠时不输出</td>\n<td>对象属性之间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ifBreak</code></td>\n<td>根据 group 是否展开选择不同输出</td>\n<td>尾逗号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[AST Node] --&gt; B{生成 Doc}&#10;    B --&gt; C[concat / group / indent]&#10;    C --&gt; D{行宽检查}&#10;    D --&gt;|超出行宽| E[展开 group 为多行]&#10;    D --&gt;|未超出| F[折叠 group 为单行]&#10;    E --&gt; G[输出多行文本]&#10;    F --&gt; H[输出单行文本]\">flowchart TD\n    A[AST Node] --&gt; B{生成 Doc}\n    B --&gt; C[concat / group / indent]\n    C --&gt; D{行宽检查}\n    D --&gt;|超出行宽| E[展开 group 为多行]\n    D --&gt;|未超出| F[折叠 group 为单行]\n    E --&gt; G[输出多行文本]\n    F --&gt; H[输出单行文本]</pre><p>以函数调用 <code>foo(arg1, arg2, arg3)</code> 为例，当参数列表较短时输出为单行，超出行宽时自动展开为多行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function printCallExpression(node: CallExpression): Doc {&#10;  return group([&#10;    printNode(node.callee),&#10;    &#39;(&#39;,&#10;    indent([softline, join([&#39;,&#39;, line], node.arguments.map(printNode))]),&#10;    softline,&#10;    &#39;)&#39;,&#10;  ]);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> printCallExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CallExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Doc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.callee),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '('</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    indent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([softline, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">','</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, line], node.arguments.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(printNode))]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    softline,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ')'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这套 Doc 系统的精妙之处在于：格式化规则只需要描述&quot;什么地方可以换行&quot;，而&quot;是否真的换行&quot;由 Doc 引擎根据行宽约束自动决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行宽约束与贪心算法\">行宽约束与贪心算法</h2><p>格式化的最终环节是将 Doc 转换为实际文本。这一步的核心挑战是<strong>行宽约束求解</strong>：在保证每行不超过指定宽度（如 80 列）的前提下，尽量将内容放在同一行以提高可读性。</p>\n<p>Prettier 采用的算法思路源自 Wadler 的贪心策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PrintState {&#10;  indentLevel: number;&#10;  currentLineWidth: number;&#10;  maxLineWidth: number;&#10;  output: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function printDoc(doc: Doc, state: PrintState): void {&#10;  switch (doc.type) {&#10;    case &#39;group&#39;: {&#10;      const flatContent = tryFlatten(doc.contents);&#10;      const flatWidth = measureWidth(flatContent);&#10;      if (state.currentLineWidth + flatWidth &lt;= state.maxLineWidth) {&#10;        printFlat(flatContent, state);&#10;      } else {&#10;        printExpanded(doc.contents, state);&#10;      }&#10;      break;&#10;    }&#10;    case &#39;indent&#39;:&#10;      state.indentLevel += 1;&#10;      printDoc(doc.contents, state);&#10;      state.indentLevel -= 1;&#10;      break;&#10;    case &#39;line&#39;:&#10;      state.output += &#39;\\n&#39; + &#39; &#39;.repeat(state.indentLevel * 2);&#10;      state.currentLineWidth = state.indentLevel * 2;&#10;      break;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrintState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indentLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentLineWidth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxLineWidth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> printDoc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">doc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Doc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrintState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (doc.type) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> flatContent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tryFlatten</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(doc.contents);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> flatWidth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measureWidth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flatContent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (state.currentLineWidth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flatWidth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.maxLineWidth) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        printFlat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flatContent, state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        printExpanded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(doc.contents, state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'indent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.indentLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      printDoc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(doc.contents, state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.indentLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'line'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state.indentLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.currentLineWidth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.indentLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>算法的关键决策点在于 <code>group</code> 节点：先尝试将整个 group 扁平化为单行，如果不超出行宽就采用单行模式；否则展开为多行。这是一种<strong>贪心策略</strong>，它不会全局最优化所有可能的换行组合，而是自顶向下逐个 group 做出局部最优决策。</p>\n<p>这种贪心策略的优势是<strong>线性时间复杂度</strong>，而全局最优的动态规划方案虽然理论上更优，但在实际场景中复杂度过高。Google 的 <code>google-java-format</code> 曾尝试使用动态规划求解最优格式化方案，但最终也采用了类似的贪心策略以确保性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注释与空白保留\">注释与空白保留</h2><p>AST 格式化面临的最大挑战之一是<strong>注释处理</strong>。注释在语法上不属于任何 AST 节点，但在格式化输出中必须出现在正确的位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const result = foo(&#10;  // 第一个参数的说明&#10;  arg1,&#10;  arg2 /* 行内注释 */,&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> foo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 第一个参数的说明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  arg1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  arg2 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 行内注释 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>格式化工具需要解决三个关键问题：</p>\n<p><strong>注释归属</strong>：将每条注释关联到最近的 AST 节点。通常的策略是根据注释的位置（行号、列号）将其归类为前导注释（leading）、尾随注释（trailing）或内部注释（inner）。</p>\n<p><strong>空行保留</strong>：用户在代码中插入的空行往往具有逻辑分组的含义。多数格式化工具会保留原始代码中的单个空行，但会将连续多个空行压缩为一个。Prettier 的策略是保留用户的空行意图，但不允许超过一个连续空行。</p>\n<p><strong>Pragma 与指令</strong>：某些注释具有特殊含义，如 <code>// prettier-ignore</code>、<code>/* eslint-disable */</code>、<code>// @ts-ignore</code> 等。格式化工具需要识别这些指令并跳过对应区域的格式化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function attachComments(ast: AST, comments: Comment[]): void {&#10;  for (const comment of comments) {&#10;    const enclosingNode = findEnclosingNode(ast, comment.start, comment.end);&#10;    const precedingNode = findPrecedingNode(enclosingNode, comment.start);&#10;    const followingNode = findFollowingNode(enclosingNode, comment.end);&#10;&#10;    if (isOnSameLine(precedingNode, comment)) {&#10;      addTrailingComment(precedingNode, comment);&#10;    } else if (followingNode) {&#10;      addLeadingComment(followingNode, comment);&#10;    } else {&#10;      addDanglingComment(enclosingNode, comment);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> attachComments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">comments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Comment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> comment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> comments) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enclosingNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findEnclosingNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ast, comment.start, comment.end);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> precedingNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findPrecedingNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(enclosingNode, comment.start);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> followingNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findFollowingNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(enclosingNode, comment.end);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isOnSameLine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(precedingNode, comment)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      addTrailingComment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(precedingNode, comment);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (followingNode) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      addLeadingComment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(followingNode, comment);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      addDanglingComment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(enclosingNode, comment);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注释处理是格式化工具中 bug 最集中的区域。Prettier 的 issue 中有大量与注释位置错误相关的报告，这也是 AST 格式化方案的固有难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多语言支持与解析器插件\">多语言支持与解析器插件</h2><p>现代格式化工具通常需要支持多种编程语言。Prettier 通过<strong>插件架构</strong>实现了对不同语言的支持，每个插件提供三个核心能力：解析器、AST 遍历器和打印器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PrettierPlugin {&#10;  parsers: Record&lt;string, Parser&gt;;&#10;  printers: Record&lt;string, Printer&gt;;&#10;  languages: Language[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Parser {&#10;  parse(text: string, options: Options): AST;&#10;  astFormat: string;&#10;  locStart(node: ASTNode): number;&#10;  locEnd(node: ASTNode): number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Printer {&#10;  print(path: AstPath, options: Options, print: PrintFn): Doc;&#10;  embed?: (path: AstPath, options: Options) =&gt; Doc | null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrettierPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parsers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  printers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Printer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  languages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  astFormat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  locStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  locEnd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Printer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AstPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">print</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrintFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Doc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  embed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AstPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Doc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多语言支持中最复杂的场景是<strong>嵌入式语言</strong>，例如 HTML 中嵌入 JavaScript、CSS，或 JavaScript 模板字符串中嵌入 GraphQL。Prettier 通过 <code>embed</code> 方法处理这种情况：当打印器遇到嵌入式语言时，它会将对应片段交给目标语言的解析器和打印器处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[HTML 源码] --&gt; B[HTML Parser]&#10;    B --&gt; C[HTML AST]&#10;    C --&gt; D{遍历节点}&#10;    D --&gt; E[style 标签]&#10;    D --&gt; F[script 标签]&#10;    D --&gt; G[普通 HTML 节点]&#10;    E --&gt; H[CSS Parser + Printer]&#10;    F --&gt; I[JS Parser + Printer]&#10;    G --&gt; J[HTML Printer]&#10;    H --&gt; K[合并输出]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n    A[HTML 源码] --&gt; B[HTML Parser]\n    B --&gt; C[HTML AST]\n    C --&gt; D{遍历节点}\n    D --&gt; E[style 标签]\n    D --&gt; F[script 标签]\n    D --&gt; G[普通 HTML 节点]\n    E --&gt; H[CSS Parser + Printer]\n    F --&gt; I[JS Parser + Printer]\n    G --&gt; J[HTML Printer]\n    H --&gt; K[合并输出]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K</pre><p>这种插件架构使得 Prettier 能够统一处理 <code>.vue</code> 单文件组件（HTML + JavaScript + CSS）、<code>.mdx</code> 文件（Markdown + JSX）等复杂的多语言混合场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((AST 格式化))&#10;    解析阶段&#10;      词法分析&#10;      语法分析&#10;      AST 构建&#10;    中间表示&#10;      Doc 命令系统&#10;      concat/group/indent&#10;      行宽感知布局&#10;    求解阶段&#10;      贪心算法&#10;      group 折叠决策&#10;      线性时间复杂度&#10;    难点处理&#10;      注释归属&#10;      空行保留&#10;      Pragma 指令&#10;    多语言支持&#10;      插件架构&#10;      嵌入式语言&#10;      统一 Doc 输出\">mindmap\n  root((AST 格式化))\n    解析阶段\n      词法分析\n      语法分析\n      AST 构建\n    中间表示\n      Doc 命令系统\n      concat/group/indent\n      行宽感知布局\n    求解阶段\n      贪心算法\n      group 折叠决策\n      线性时间复杂度\n    难点处理\n      注释归属\n      空行保留\n      Pragma 指令\n    多语言支持\n      插件架构\n      嵌入式语言\n      统一 Doc 输出</pre><ul>\n<li>AST 格式化通过&quot;解析 → 中间表示 → 求解输出&quot;三阶段实现确定性格式化</li>\n<li>Doc 命令系统将&quot;可以换行的位置&quot;与&quot;是否换行的决策&quot;解耦</li>\n<li>贪心算法在 group 节点做出局部最优的折叠/展开决策，保证线性性能</li>\n<li>注释处理是 AST 格式化中最复杂的部分，需要精确的位置归属逻辑</li>\n<li>插件架构通过统一的 Parser + Printer 接口支持多语言和嵌入式语言场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于 AST 的格式化原理","id":"基于-ast-的格式化原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AST 解析与节点遍历","id":"ast-解析与节点遍历"},{"level":2,"text":"中间表示与 Doc 命令","id":"中间表示与-doc-命令"},{"level":2,"text":"行宽约束与贪心算法","id":"行宽约束与贪心算法"},{"level":2,"text":"注释与空白保留","id":"注释与空白保留"},{"level":2,"text":"多语言支持与解析器插件","id":"多语言支持与解析器插件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"Prettier 深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/prettier-deep-dive"}}